163A D718             (         rect.asm):00272                         STB     <R_X0
163C 971A             (         rect.asm):00273                         STA     <R_X1
163E 9619             (         rect.asm):00274         RS_1            LDA     <R_Y0
1640 911B             (         rect.asm):00275                         CMPA    <R_Y1
